{% comment %}
  11FIT High-Converting Product FAQs with JSON-LD FAQPage Schema for Google Rich Snippets
{% endcomment %}

<div class="fit11-faq-container" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-top: 4px;">
  <div class="fit11-faq-item" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom: 10px;">
    <h4 style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--lux-text, #111); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
      <span style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 700;">Q.</span> Are 11FIT shorts suitable for heavy gym workouts, squats &amp; running?
    </h4>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--lux-text-muted, #555);">
      <strong>Yes, 100%.</strong> Engineered with 4-way stretch lycra and breathable quick-dry microfibers, they provide unrestricted movement during squats, cardio, and running. Includes deep anti-slip zipper pockets to safely hold smartphones up to 6.7 inches.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="fit11-faq-item" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom: 10px;">
    <h4 style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--lux-text, #111); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
      <span style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 700;">Q.</span> How does the &ldquo;3 Shorts @ ₹899&rdquo; combo offer work?
    </h4>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--lux-text-muted, #555);">
      Simply select the 3-Pack option or add any 3 eligible shorts to your cart. The flat ₹899 bundle pricing applies automatically at checkout with <strong>Free Pan-India Delivery</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="fit11-faq-item" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom: 10px;">
    <h4 style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--lux-text, #111); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
      <span style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 700;">Q.</span> What fabric is used and how should I wash it?
    </h4>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--lux-text-muted, #555);">
      We use premium 4-Way Stretch Lycra blend (88% performance polyester / nylon + 12% spandex). Machine wash cold inside out, do not bleach, and tumble dry low or hang in shade for long-lasting elasticity.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="fit11-faq-item" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom: 10px;">
    <h4 style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--lux-text, #111); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
      <span style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 700;">Q.</span> How long does delivery take and is Cash on Delivery (COD) available?
    </h4>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--lux-text-muted, #555);">
      Yes, <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD)</strong> is available across all Indian pin codes. Orders are dispatched within 24 hours. Metro cities receive delivery in <strong>2&ndash;4 days</strong>, rest of India in <strong>3&ndash;5 days</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="fit11-faq-item">
    <h4 style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--lux-text, #111); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
      <span style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 700;">Q.</span> What if the size does not fit? Can I exchange?
    </h4>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--lux-text-muted, #555);">
      Yes! We offer a <strong>7-Day Free Size Exchange</strong>. If the fit isn't perfect, our customer support team (+91-7404061408) will arrange a seamless size exchange. Just ensure to record a short unboxing video upon delivery.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

